      "text": "Honest scope:\n• code units = endpoints + hubs, NOT branches\n(graphify is symbol-level).\n• 'reached' = design-time NAME-MATCH,\nnot executed coverage.\n• thin/absent codegraph → requirement-only\n(says so; no false completeness).\nExecuted coverage + mutation = Q6 (executor).",
